### Feature Module Standard Pattern
Every feature folder in `src/features/<feature-name>/` follows a uniform pattern:
- `components/` — UI components specific to the feature
- `hooks/` — React hooks for state/side-effects
- `logic/` — **Pure functions** containing business rules (evaluation delta calculation, PGN parsing, emotion mapping)
- `__tests__/` — Vitest unit tests targeting the pure logic
- `types.ts` — TypeScript definitions & contracts
- `index.ts` — Clean barrel export of public interfaces

